# Environment variables the Cloud Functions expect.
#
# Copy this file to functions/.env and fill in the real values. That file is
# excluded by .gitignore and is never committed, which is exactly why this one
# exists: without it there is nothing in the repository saying the variable is
# needed at all, and a new environment silently comes up without it.
#
# The uid of the account that must never be deleted. When this is missing the
# deletion guard cannot match anybody, so it skips itself - it now says so in
# the log on every call, and ordinary account deletion keeps working.
# See DOCS/PLANING/21-super-admin-guard-inert.md.
SUPER_ADMIN_UID=
